    "group": "The Angelic Host",
    "summary": "Some of your **ADEPTUS ASTARTES JUMP PACK** units can go into **strategic reserves** as your opponent's turn ends, then have to make an **[ingress move](vsdata:core-rule/ingress-move)** during the Movement phase of your next turn, your first turn included. Units within **Engagement Range** of an enemy unit cannot be chosen, and battle size limits how many can:\n\n- Incursion: 1\n- Strike Force: 2\n- Onslaught: 3",
